The tester's 62340 (55014): B's card carried the model's own „სხვა პასუხი"
and the server's „სხვა, მე დავწერ" after it, two buttons for one act.
withServerOther checked only for its own exact label. A model-written
„other" (the same starts withOtherChoice already recognises) is now
dropped and the server's goes last, since only the server's opens the box
instead of sending a word.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
